<title>보행 스타일 선호 원고 (한국어)</title>
<meta name="claude:viewport-fit-sides" content="cover">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Serif+KR:wght@400;600&family=Source+Serif+4:ital,opsz,wght@0,8..60,400;0,8..60,600;1,8..60,400&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500&display=swap">
<style>
:root{--bg:#fbfaf7;--fg:#1d1c1a;--muted:#6a6862;--rule:#dcd9d1;--panel:#f1efe9;--accent:#2a5fa8;--todo:#b3261e;--todo-bg:#fbe9e7}
@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]){--bg:#17181a;--fg:#e6e4df;--muted:#a09d96;--rule:#3a3a3c;--panel:#222326;--accent:#8db4ee;--todo:#ff8a80;--todo-bg:#3a2321;color-scheme:dark}}
:root[data-theme="dark"]{--bg:#17181a;--fg:#e6e4df;--muted:#a09d96;--rule:#3a3a3c;--panel:#222326;--accent:#8db4ee;--todo:#ff8a80;--todo-bg:#3a2321;color-scheme:dark}
body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--fg);font:16.5px/1.75 "Source Serif 4","Noto Serif KR",Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;padding-left:max(16px,env(safe-area-inset-left,0px));padding-right:max(16px,env(safe-area-inset-right,0px));padding-block:0 64px}
main{max-width:44rem;margin:0 auto}
.bar{max-width:44rem;margin:0 auto;padding-block:20px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);font:13px/1.5 "IBM Plex Sans",system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--muted);display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px 18px}
.bar b{color:var(--fg);font-weight:500}
.bar .t{color:var(--todo)}
header{text-align:center;margin-block:36px 28px}
h1.title{font-size:1.75rem;line-height:1.25;font-weight:600;text-wrap:balance;margin:0 0 10px}
.author{color:var(--muted);margin:0}
.abstract{text-align:left;margin-top:28px;padding:16px 20px;background:var(--panel);border-radius:6px;font-size:.95rem}
.abstract-title{font-weight:600;text-align:center;margin:0 0 6px;font-variant:small-caps;letter-spacing:.04em}
h1,h2,h3,h4,h5{text-wrap:balance;line-height:1.3}
h1{font-size:1.35rem;margin:2.2em 0 .5em;font-weight:600}
h2{font-size:1.12rem;margin:1.8em 0 .4em;font-weight:600}
h3,h4,h5{font-size:1rem;margin:1.2em 0 .2em;font-weight:600}
.runin{font-weight:600;margin-right:.3em}
.header-section-number{margin-right:.5em;color:var(--muted)}
p{margin:.7em 0;word-break:keep-all}
a{color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none}
a:hover{text-decoration:underline}
.todo{color:var(--todo);background:var(--todo-bg);font-weight:500;padding:0 3px;border-radius:3px}
figure{margin:1.6em 0;text-align:center}
figure img{background:#fff;border-radius:4px;max-width:100%;height:auto}
figcaption,.tcap{font-size:.86rem;line-height:1.5;color:var(--muted);text-align:left;margin-top:8px}
.tcap{margin:1.8em 0 0}
.tcap+.tw{margin-top:8px}
.tw{overflow-x:auto;margin:1.6em 0}
table{border-collapse:collapse;font:13px/1.4 "IBM Plex Sans",system-ui,sans-serif;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;margin:0 auto;border-top:1.5px solid var(--fg);border-bottom:1.5px solid var(--fg)}
th,td{padding:4px 8px;white-space:nowrap}
thead th{border-bottom:1px solid var(--fg)}
td{border-top:1px solid transparent}
.eq{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;overflow-x:auto;margin:1em 0}
.eq math{flex:1;min-width:0}
.eqno{color:var(--muted);font-size:.95rem}
math{font-size:1.02em}
.references,#refs{font-size:.9rem}
.csl-entry{margin:.5em 0;padding-left:1.5em;text-indent:-1.5em}
@media (max-width:520px){body{font-size:16px}h1.title{font-size:1.4rem}}
</style>
<div class="bar"><span><b>한국어 번역본</b> · 영문 원고(제출본)를 옮긴 검토용, 수치·식·인용은 영문과 동일</span><span>기준 커밋 <b>{{COMMIT}}</b></span><span>제출은 영문 원고로</span></div>
<main>
{{BODY}}
</main>
